# Dharma Doujou text table. Key = the 16-bit LE text word as hex (value, not byte order).
# bits 13-14: 0000 = 16x16 glyph (tiles N..N+3), 2000 = 8x16 narrow (N over N+1), 4000 = 8x8 bottom-half tile N, 6000 = 24x24 picture (9 tiles).
# Words >= 8000 are control codes (low byte = argument); see docs/re/text.md.
